\par\par \uc2 U.S. News\par \uc2 US\par \b \uc2 A State-by-State Guide to  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Access in the U.S. Track where  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  is legal, banned or under threat after the Supreme Court overturned Roe v. Wade\b0\par\par\uc2 By Kara Dapena and Jennifer Calfas \par \uc2 315 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 May 2026\par 23:23 GMT\par \uc2 wsj.com\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2026 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 The Supreme Court decision {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturning Roe v. Wade}}}\uc2  in June 2022 created a patchwork of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access across the U.S., with millions of women of reproductive age now living in states where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is largely illegal.\par \par \uc2 The fall of the landmark 1973 ruling shifted decisions about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  back to states, where the political makeup of legislatures has played a significant role in determining restrictions and regulations.\par \par \uc2 State supreme courts {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/georgias-six-week-abortion-ban-reinstated-by-state-supreme-court-11669224954"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 have allowed new bans to take effect}}}\uc2 , while others {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/south-carolinas-6-week-abortion-ban-ruled-unconstitutional-11672940087"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 declined}}}\uc2  to block the laws. Clinics have closed in states where bans are now enforced and opened in others where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  remains legal. State legislatures are debating {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/gov-ron-desantis-signs-florida-six-week-abortion-ban-b18029cc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new restrictions}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/minnesota-with-new-democratic-control-enacts-state-abortion-rights-11675190873"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 protections}}}\uc2 . Some voters {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/elections/abortion-vote-ballot-measures-democrat-losses-f6b35078"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 enshrined the right to an \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  in their state constitutions through citizen-led ballot initiatives. Municipalities in some states where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  remains legal {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/in-states-where-abortion-is-legal-some-cities-look-to-restrict-access-11671749172"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 have tried to ban \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  within their communities.\par \par \uc2 Bans listed in the map above and below refer to restrictions on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  at about six weeks of pregnancy or less. Less than half of abortions occur at or before that time, according to 2020 data from the U.S. Centers for Disease Control and Prevention.\par \par \uc2 This article may be periodically updated.\par \par \uc2 Methodology\par \par \uc2 Reproductive-age women are those 15 to 44 years old, according to the Census Bureau's American Community Survey five-year estimates for 2023, and calculated as a share of the total number of women in the age group in the 50 U.S. states plus Washington, D.C. Neighbors are bordering states and the District of Columbia and include water borders.\par \par \uc2 Sources: \uc2 Guttmacher Institute\uc2  and staff reports (bans, protections, gestational limits); National Conference of State Legislatures and \uc2 National Governors Association\uc2  (party control)\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020260501em51008n5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
