\par\par \uc2 Commentary (U.S.)\par \uc2 Opinion\par \b \uc2 Make \uc2 HHS\uc2  and \uc2 FDA\uc2  Pro-Life Again; Approval of generic mifepristone is why I warned against RFK Jr.'s appointment.\b0\par\par\uc2 By Mike Pence \par \uc2 558 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 October 2025\par 16:47 GMT\par \uc2 wsj.com\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2025 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 I will always consider serving as vice president in the most pro-life administration in history one of my life's highest honors. Of all our accomplishments, none mattered more to me than the appointment of Supreme Court justices who overturned Roe v. Wade, ending a travesty of jurisprudence that took the lives of more than 63 million unborn Americans.\par \par \uc2 I know firsthand how committed President Trump was to the cause of life throughout our administration. We supported efforts to end late-term abortions nationwide, restored the Mexico City policy, defended conscience rights, protected faith-based providers of services for pregnant women, allowed states to defund \uc2 Planned Parenthood\uc2 , and appointed nearly 300 judges committed to interpreting the Constitution as written.\par \par \uc2 That's why it is so disappointing to see the second Trump administration retreat from the pro-life cause with the Food and Drug Administration's recent approval of a generic version of mifepristone, a chemical \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill manufactured by Evita Solutions. This is a profound betrayal of the pro-life movement that elected President Trump. The \uc2 FDA\uc2 's approval means more mail-order \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , more women harmed, and more unborn children lost.\par \par \uc2 Evita Solutions is explicit about its mission to "normalize \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 " and make it "accessible to all." By authorizing Evita's new generic, the administration is enabling the company's agenda and signaling that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills are simply another consumer product.\par \par \uc2 Mifepristone is a powerful chemical cocktail specifically designed to end a developing human life. It carries serious risks for women, among them hemorrhaging, infection and even death. Complications from chemical abortions send thousands of women to emergency rooms each year. By promoting its widespread use, the administration advances a culture of death and jeopardizes the health and safety of mothers.\par \par \uc2 Bureaucrats at the \uc2 FDA\uc2  claim they had no choice but to approve this drug. Nonsense. The executive has the authority and duty to ensure the law protects life and women\u8212\'20\'14by restoring robust safety requirements and in-person medical supervision, preventing reckless mail-order dispensing, and refusing to treat \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  as a legitimate commercial service. Mr. Trump was elected to rein in the administrative state, not abdicate to it.\par \par \uc2 Earlier this year, I urged the Senate to reject \uc2 Robert F. Kennedy Jr.\uc2 's nomination as health and human services secretary because he was unfit for the role, especially given the risk that he'd expand access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . That's precisely what has occurred.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Trump should act swiftly to reverse this decision. Government's first duty is to protect the lives of its own citizens, born and unborn. If Mr. Kennedy won't defend the most vulnerable among us, he should step aside so the president can nominate a leader who will.\par \par \uc2 The pro-life movement is rooted in the timeless truth that every human life is created in God's image. For four years, I worked proudly alongside President Trump to advance it. I pray he will stand again with the millions of Americans who cherish the unborn, and rejoin this noble cause with the same courage that defined his first term.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Pence served as vice president, 2017-21, and is founder of the conservative advocacy group Advancing American Freedom.\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020251008ela800462\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
