\par\par \uc2 Election 2024\par \uc2 Politics\par \b \uc2 Harris Bets on Big Turnout Among Women to Push Her Over Finish Line; The vice president and surrogates, including \uc2 Michelle Obama\uc2 , are making emotional appeals to women about  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  and health\b0\par\par\uc2 By Catherine Lucey \par \uc2 1,461 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 November 2024\par 01:02 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2024 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 PHOENIX\u8212\'20\'14{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/topics/person/kamala-harris"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kamala Harris}}}\uc2  is making a bet in the final days of a deadlocked election campaign that turning out women voters is her best path to the presidency.\par \par \uc2 In a race that has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/elections/trump-harris-gender-gap-poll-9d15b340"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 defined by gender politics}}}\uc2 , getting women to the polls is a crucial task for Harris. The Democratic vice president, who remains neck-and-neck with Republican former President {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/topics/person/donald-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2 , has made \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights and the importance of giving women freedom over their bodies a central part of her final message. She has stressed Trump's role appointing three justices to the Supreme Court that overturned Roe v. Wade, and seized on Trump's recent remark that he would\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/livecoverage/harris-trump-election-10-31-24/card/trump-vows-to-protect-women-whether-the-women-like-it-or-not--PXgkdIYacMz4DNMK9bTG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 "protect" women}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Helping Harris is \uc2 Michelle Obama\uc2 , who is typically a reluctant campaigner. Last week the former first lady delivered a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/video/michelle-obama-the-presidential-race-is-too-close-for-my-liking/3C8E7262-282A-4467-AB7E-6C88D9F63C88"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 blistering address}}}\uc2  in Michigan in which she graphically detailed how limits to reproductive healthcare affect women's bodies, and she made a plea to men to "take our lives seriously."\par \par \uc2 Obama continued to make her case Saturday in Pennsylvania, following up on a get-out-the-vote rally this week focused on young people. She told the crowd in Norristown that with Harris "instead of someone who'd accelerate the dismantling of our women's \b \highlight22\uc2 reproductive health\b0 \highlight\uc2  system, we will have a president who believes in our freedom to make decisions about our own bodies."\par \par \uc2 To cheers, Obama also argued that the election was fundamentally about "reclaiming the mantle of who belongs in this nation," condemning what she said was the coarse and derogatory language that has defined Trump's campaign.\par \par \uc2 Harris, for her part, spent Saturday rallying voters in Charlotte and Atlanta. First lady Jill Biden and other surrogates such as Democratic Michigan Gov. \uc2 Gretchen Whitmer\uc2  were also working to get out the vote.\par \par \uc2 A Harris adviser said that if she wins, it will be attributable to a large turnout among women\u8212\'20\'14especially younger, college educated and suburban women\u8212\'20\'14and limiting the losses among men. The Harris camp says it has managed to shift some Trump-supporting women by detailing his past statements on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . In 2016, Democratic presidential nominee \uc2 Hillary Clinton\uc2  beat Trump among women voters by 15 percentage points, according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.pewresearch.org/politics/2018/08/09/an-examination-of-the-2016-electorate-based-on-validated-voters/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pew Research Center}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Since the Dobbs decision {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturning Roe v. Wade in 2022}}}\uc2 , women have turned out in midterms, special elections and for ballot referendums on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  to power Democratic victories. Both parties are now scouring polls and data about people who have already voted for any signs of supercharged turnout among women.\par \par \uc2 National and swing-state polls have shown Trump enjoying a strong advantage with men, but struggling to land a winning message with women. He has run a campaign featuring a hypermasculine message, at times defined by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/elections/tony-hinchcliffe-trump-madison-square-garden-rally-845949d9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 coarse and sexist language}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Trump has tried to moderate his stance on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , saying he wouldn't support a national ban. He recently offered a tax break for people who take care of a parent or loved one, after Harris rolled out a plan to have Medicare cover in-home healthcare.\par \par \uc2 The former president has also argued that women's safety is under threat, promising to protect them. In Wisconsin this week, Trump said his advisers had told him to stop casting himself as a protector of women. "I said, 'Well, I'm going to do it whether the women like it or not,'" said Trump. "I'm going to protect them."\par \par \uc2 Democrats and Harris highlighted those remarks, with the vice president declaring in Phoenix: "There's a saying that you gotta listen to people when they tell you who you are or who they are. And this is not the first time he has told us he does not believe women should have the agency and authority to make decisions about their own bodies."\par \par \uc2 "We trust women," said Harris to cheers.\par \par \uc2 Trump spokeswoman Karoline Leavitt asked "Why does \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  take issue with President Trump wanting to protect women, men, and children from migrant crime and foreign adversaries?"\par \par \uc2 Trump's campaign has also pushed back by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/livecoverage/harris-trump-election-10-31-24/card/republicans-denounce-mark-cuban-s-saying-that-trump-never-seen-around-strong-intelligent-women--fJXPBeIgZiWFlBmeJgvw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 highlighting a comment}}}\uc2  from Harris-supporting billionaire \uc2 Mark Cuban\uc2 , who said that Trump doesn't surround himself with smart women. Some of Trump's female advisers promptly shared photos of themselves with the former president on social media.\par \par \uc2 Trump also drew attention this week when he said would have \uc2 Robert F. Kennedy Jr.\uc2  "work on health and women's health." Harris responded to the suggestion with a one-word social-media post: "No." Kennedy\u8212\'20\'14who endorsed Trump after ending an independent bid for president\u8212\'20\'14has questioned the safety and efficacy of Covid-19 vaccine and other government-endorsed vaccines. Kennedy has expressed conflicting views on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access.\par \par \uc2 Trump senior adviser \uc2 Jason Miller\uc2  said the campaign is focused on winning the election, but said Trump had made clear Kennedy would play an important role. A campaign official also said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  issue would be left to the states.\par \par \uc2 On Thursday, Trump {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/livecoverage/harris-trump-election-11-01-24/card/watch-trump-calls-liz-cheney-radical-war-hawk--sTiDEISVgphgdyWxzb8X"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 went after}}}\uc2  former GOP Rep. \uc2 Liz Cheney\uc2 , a critic of the former president who has endorsed Harris, during an interview with \uc2 Tucker Carlson\uc2 . "She's a radical war hawk," Trump said, suggesting Cheney should be sent into battle. "Let's put her with a rifle standing there with nine barrels shooting at her, OK? Let's see how she feels about it, you know, when the guns are trained on her face."\par \par \uc2 Trump has a long history of making crude and disparaging remarks about women. In 2023, a federal jury found him liable for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/donald-trump-found-liable-in-e-jean-carroll-civil-case-ordered-to-pay-5-million-for-sexual-abuse-and-defamation-25e175b9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sexually abusing and defaming}}}\uc2  advice columnist E. Jean Carroll in a Manhattan department store 30 years ago. He denied the charges.\par \par \uc2 Galvanize Action, a nonprofit focused on moderate women, since the spring has been tracking a group of more than 6,000 moderate white women in 10 states, including the seven battleground states. Jackie Payne, the group's founder, said that they have moved slightly toward Harris.\par \par \uc2 Payne said those voters put priority on the economy, democracy, \b \highlight22\uc2 reproductive rights\b0 \highlight\uc2  and immigration. They give Trump an edge on the economy and immigration and Harris an advantage on democracy and \b \highlight22\uc2 reproductive rights\b0 \highlight\uc2 . "They view it as a freedom and they connect it to healthcare writ large," she said of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Over the course of the presidential race, women campaigning for Democrats have come forward with harrowing stories of pregnancy complications and healthcare struggles, speaking in detail about miscarriages, ectopic pregnancies and fertility care in a way that was once unheard of in public life.\par \par \uc2 A recent ad featured a Texas woman who couldn't receive an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  during a miscarriage and developed a life-threatening infection. She shows a scar on her abdomen from an emergency surgery, and the ad states she might never be able to have children.\par \par \uc2 Obama gave voice to those experiences in Kalamazoo, saying: "If your wife is shivering and bleeding on the operating room table during a routine delivery gone bad, her pressure dropping as she loses more and more blood or some unforeseen infection spreads, and her doctors aren't sure if they can act, you will be the one praying that it's not too late."\par \par \uc2 Delaney Tunstall, 21 years old, of Scottsdale, Ariz., said \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  was an important reason she was backing Harris. The \uc2 Arizona State University\uc2  student said she had an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in May 2022\u8212\'20\'14before the Dobbs decision\u8212\'20\'14and that if she hadn't had the option "it would have had a drastic impact on my life."\par \par \uc2 SHARE YOUR THOUGHTS\par \par \uc2 How do you view the gender divide in American politics? Join the conversation below.\par \par \uc2 Obama's comments haven't gone unnoticed by Trump, who called her "nasty."\par \par \uc2 One challenge for Harris is that some women in battleground states who support \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights say they plan to support Trump. A recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/elections/trump-leads-harris-wsj-poll-779f8516"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Wall Street Journal national poll}}}\uc2  found that 33% of Trump voters say they want \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  to be legal with some or no restrictions, compared with 62% who want it to be illegal with some or no exceptions. A total of 92% of Harris voters support legal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  some or all of the time, while 6% say it should be illegal.\par \par \uc2 Jillian Glasser, 61, of Lower Gwynedd, Pa., has already voted for Trump. She said she thought \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  should be safe and legal, but "I just don't think Pennsylvania is going to overturn it." Of Trump, the retiree said: "I think we have to take him at his word. I really don't think he is going to do anything dramatic."\par \par \uc2 Write to Catherine Lucey at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:catherine_lucey@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 catherine_lucey@wsj.com}}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020241102ekb200007\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
