\par\par \uc2 Election 2024\par \uc2 Politics\par \b \uc2 Trump Claims Women 'Will No Longer Be Thinking About  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2 ' if He Wins; Republican nominee trails among women voters behind \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 , who has made  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  a centerpiece of her campaign message\b0\par\par\uc2 By Natalie Andrews and Catherine Lucey \par \uc2 679 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 September 2024\par 21:13 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2024 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Former President \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  claimed women won't think about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  anymore if he wins the election, a day after Vice President \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  argued he was the "architect" of a reproductive healthcare crisis.\par \par \uc2 Trump said in a lengthy all-caps {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://truthsocial.com/@realDonaldTrump/posts/113173471737127661"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 social-media post}}}\uc2  late Friday, and again at a rally in North Carolina Saturday, that women are less healthy, less safe, more depressed and less optimistic than they were four years ago when he was president. Speaking directly to women, he said: "You will no longer be thinking about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 " because the issue has now been returned to the states to decide.\par \par \uc2 The comments underscored Trump's anxiety over the issue, which has proven to be a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/elections/trump-harris-gender-gap-poll-9d15b340"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 powerful motivator for women}}}\uc2  and could play a major role in the suburban areas that may decide the election. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/topics/person/kamala-harris"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Harris campaign}}}\uc2  quickly circulated his remarks, with a spokeswoman saying: "After ripping away our reproductive freedom, now he's trying to tell us how to think."\par \par \uc2 Harris, who has campaigned aggressively on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights, traveled to Georgia Friday where she assailed Trump for appointing three of the Supreme Court justices who overturned Roe v. Wade in 2022, and blamed Trump for states' restrictive \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  laws. "This is a healthcare crisis, and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/topics/person/donald-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  is the architect of this crisis," she said.\par \par \uc2 She also referenced {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.propublica.org/article/georgia-abortion-ban-amber-thurman-death"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reporting by ProPublica}}}\uc2  on two women who died in Georgia, arguing that it was due to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  laws in the state. "He is proud," Harris said. "Proud that women are dying?\u8230\'20\'26How dare he?"\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/elections/trump-harris-poll-august-election-2024-e6fa024e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Wall Street Journal poll}}}\uc2  taken in late August found Harris leading Trump in a head-to-head matchup among women voters by 13 percentage points, while Trump led among men by 10 percentage points. Asked whether there was an issue they felt so strongly about that they wouldn't vote for a candidate they disagreed with on it, 33% of women in the poll identified \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8212\'20\'14far higher than any other issue.\par \par \uc2 The Supreme Court ruling overturning Roe has unfurled a messy patchwork of state laws across the country. When Roe was overturned, about half of the states sought to ban or heavily restrict \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Today, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/us-news/abortion-state-guide-laws-bf5072da?mod=article_inline"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 that number stands at around 18}}}\uc2 , in part because \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights groups have won seven straight ballot referendums.\par \par \uc2 While Trump has continued to brag about overturning Roe, he has wavered on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as the issue has proved motivating for Democrats in midterm and off-year elections.\par \par \uc2 Trump, a Florida resident, said earlier this month that the state's current ban on the procedure after six weeks of pregnancy {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/elections/donald-trump-gives-mixed-signals-on-florida-abortion-referendum-2782c55c?mod=article_inline"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 was too short}}}\uc2 , and suggested he would vote for a ballot initiative that would allow \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  until fetal viability, or about halfway through a typical pregnancy. His campaign walked back the comments, and Trump a day later {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/policy/trump-says-he-will-vote-against-florida-abortion-referendum-c0648486?mod=article_inline"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said he would vote n}}}\uc2 o.\par \par \uc2 In citing opposition to the Florida measure, Trump said Democrats were "radical" and wanted to legalize the procedure until the ninth month of a pregnancy. He falsely claimed some states allow a mother to "execute the baby after birth." Infanticide is illegal in every state. Major medical associations say abortions can only be performed during a pregnancy, not after it has ended.\par \par \uc2 Harris said she supports legislation that would restore the protections in Roe v. Wade, which would make \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  widely legal until fetal viability, or until roughly 23 weeks of pregnancy. Roe provided exceptions after that if a woman's life or health was in danger.\par \par \uc2 Harris has repeatedly said that Trump would sign a national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban. Trump has said he won't do that, but in his lone debate with Harris he declined to commit to vetoing such legislation if it were to come across his desk.\par \par \uc2 Write to Natalie Andrews at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:natalie.andrews@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 natalie.andrews@wsj.com}}}\uc2  and Catherine Lucey at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:catherine.lucey@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 catherine.lucey@wsj.com}}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020240921ek9l001e1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
