\par \par \uc2 Collin Mertz aboard a tractor on the Mertz Farm north of Hurdsfield, N.D. PHOTO: Lewis Ableidinger for WSJ\par \par \uc2 "The American flag is in the background, and there's blood on his face," Mertz said, "I mean, it just looks pretty badass."\par \par \uc2 Following Trump's decision to tap Sen. JD Vance (R., Ohio) as his running mate, a 2021 video of Vance resurfaced online in which he appeared to dismiss Harris and other Democrats who don't have biological children as "a bunch of childless cat ladies who are miserable at their own lives and the choices that they've made."\par \par \uc2 The video went viral, showing a wide gap between the candidates about the status of women and further galvanizing support for Harris, according to her supporters.\par \par \uc2 Harris, the expected Democratic nominee, is pressing her party's argument that the wave of new state \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions strips fundamental rights from women. The protection of \b \highlight22\uc2 reproductive rights\b0 \highlight\uc2  is a far more salient issue for women than for men, Journal polls found.\par \par \uc2 The gender divisions reflect the increasingly different experiences of American women and men in their 20s, as well as the influence of campaign messages from candidates and parties.\par \par \uc2 Women now make up a record {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/college-university-fall-higher-education-men-women-enrollment-admissions-back-to-school-11630948233"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 60% of college students}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://educationdata.org/student-loan-debt-by-gender#:~:text=Women%20hold%2066%25%20of%20all,to%20pay%20off%20student%20loans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 carry 66% of all student-loan debt}}}\uc2 , research shows. They support the Biden administration's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/policy/bidens-student-loan-plan-seeks-to-slash-debt-for-30-million-americans-12a00eba"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 push to forgive student loans}}}\uc2  more than young men do, Journal polling finds.\par \par \uc2 Speaking from his tractor as he planted soybeans one recent day, Mertz said he paid the tuition for his associate degree in agronomy and doesn't like the idea of the government forgiving the loans of others.\par \par \uc2 In recent years, women coming into adulthood lived through events many saw as an affront: Trump's crude remarks about women aired during the 2016 campaign, the Senate confirmation of \uc2 Brett Kavanaugh\uc2  to the Supreme Court amid sexual-assault allegations against him, and the high court's decision to overturn Roe v. Wade. \par \par {\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw640\pich426\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal9600\pichgoal6390
