\par \par \uc2 Lauren Starrett standing outside her home in Cincinnati. PHOTO: Maddie McGarvey for WSJ\par \par \uc2 Vincent Lester, a 19-year-old landscaper in northeast Ohio, said liberals have failed young men like him by imposing what he called purity tests that alienate people with differing views. "A lot of young men are leaning toward the right," said Lester. He has no plans for college and lives with his grandparents, in part, he said, because he can't afford his own place.\par \par \uc2 The shift toward Trump includes Black and Latino men. Young Black men had backed Biden over Trump by about 70 percentage points in 2020, and Latino men backed Biden by more than 40 points, according to AP VoteCast.\par \par \uc2 Journal polls found support for Biden shrank this year before the president withdrew from the race, leaving him with a narrow lead, as small as in the single digits, among nonwhite men.\par \par \uc2 Young white men have leaned Republican in the past and showed signs of shifting in greater numbers to the GOP this year.\par \par \uc2 Some men interviewed said they were fearful of criticism by women and expressed their resentments only in private and with other men. Several said they hide their conservative views because women they know have said they won't date right-leaning men.\par \par \uc2 Other men say they are drawn to the so-called manosphere, a loose collection of male influencers who espouse macho, "anti-woke" views. The hyper-masculinity of the right, many of them said, is at the core of its appeal, not policies or party politics.\par \par \uc2 "Young men just want freedom, recklessness, adrenaline," said Lester, who kickboxes in his spare time.\par \par \uc2 In February, Trump showed up at a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/elections/donald-trump-courts-sneakerheads-with-399-gilded-high-tops-ea2e334c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sneaker convention in Philadelphia}}}\uc2 , where he hawked his own brand of $399 "Never Surrender'' high-tops. In June, he strode into an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/elections/donald-trump-is-a-heavyweight-with-raucous-ufc-crowd-3b23be6d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ultimate Fighting Championship event}}}\uc2  in New Jersey.\par \par \uc2 On Trump's TikTok account recently, the former president posted a mock face-off with Logan Paul, the widely followed social-media-personality-turned-boxer.\par \par \uc2 This week, Trump played a round of golf with U.S. Open champion and social-media star Bryson DeChambeau. A \uc2 YouTube\uc2  video of their match racked up close to seven million views within three days and became the No. 1 trending video on the platform.\par \par \uc2 'Made me think'\par \par \uc2 Many young people said their political views hardened years before they could vote.\par \par \uc2 "Even back in 2016, when I was a 12-year-old trying to make sense of my place in the world and one of the candidates for president was making crude remarks toward women about their body parts\u8212\'20\'14even at that age I felt it wasn't right," Isabelle Ems, a 19-year-old rising junior at \uc2 Pennsylvania State University\uc2 , said of Trump.\par \par \uc2 Harrison Wells, 22, said Trump's 2016 campaign initiated his shift to the political right. He recalled being confused by the apoplectic reaction from teachers and students to Trump's victory. His high school canceled classes and held listening sessions with students.\par \par \uc2 "People were crying, upset," he said. "Everyone was hysterical."\par \par \uc2 The experience crystallized growing skepticism of his private Catholic high school outside Menlo Park, Calif., which organized lectures about the importance of access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and contraceptives and celebrated transgender visibility.\par \par \uc2 "I felt as though there was a narrative and certain school of thought that was being pushed on us aggressively," said Wells. "That was what made me think and start learning more about politics." \par \par {\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw600\pich480\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal9000\pichgoal7200
